= The Mass Party

The Kuomintang is a party dedicated to the liberation of all the oppressed people of China, however we should still define a policy in regards to the common laborers and peasants and their role in the party and the revolution.

Current stance on the mass party: 

- @root: We shouldn't change our stance at the moment
- @ideology: Let us change a different stance


